<v Maya>12th, 2026. Yeah. It's called. How Organizations Use AI Evidence from ChatGPT, authored by researchers from OpenAI, Columbia Business School, and Wharton. And this paper is completely unprecedented because the researchers, well, they didn't ask anyone what they were</v>

